    narr:generatedFrom "45b1422ae88f59e1b67101d8aaa94d124baa6812" ;
    narr:narration """On 2026-08-10, Quinton Fairweather issued a standing directive mandating [monthly Atlas rollback rehearsals](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1), justified by the principle that [an unrehearsed rollback is one you do not actually have](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2). The directive is operationalized through two concrete bullets: a [cadence specification](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3) restating the monthly schedule and an [ownership assignment](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4) naming Fairweather as the accountable owner. The hub's frame asks whether this content names a recurring, owned, cadenced discipline that keeps emergency capabilities usable — and the children collectively answer yes: a standing policy, a justifying principle, a cadence, and an owner. The [broader narrative claim](narr:Narrative_RehearsedCapabilityIsRealCapability) elevates the specific directive into a general thesis: rehearsed capability is the only capability that actually exists, making the cadence-plus-ownership structure itself the proof of capability. The register is technical-plain-spoken with antithetical parallelism in the justifying principle, carrying the weight of the argument.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RehearsedCapabilityIsRealCapability> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Atlas rollback rehearsals run monthly from now on." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "A rollback\nwe have not rehearsed is a rollback we do not actually have." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Cadence**: monthly Atlas rollback rehearsals" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The justifying principle is stated as universal and abstract — 'a rollback we have not rehearsed' — while the directive itself is narrowly scoped to Atlas only, leaving open whether the discipline generalizes beyond one system." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The broader narrative claim that rehearsed capability is the only capability that exists is an epistemic assertion stronger than the operational directive it grounds — the policy mandates a cadence, but the narrative frame asserts that anything unrehearsed is categorically nonexistent." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RehearsedCapabilityIsRealCapability> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "Decision-mode conviction — the directive is issued as settled policy, not proposal; the justifying principle is stated as axiomatic, not argued." ; narr:text "A rollback\nwe have not rehearsed is a rollback we do not actually have." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "Antithetical parallelism — the sentence names what a thing is by first naming what it isn't, the structure itself carrying the rhetorical force." ; narr:text "A rollback\nwe have not rehearsed is a rollback we do not actually have." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "power" ; narr:reading "Legitimate authority backed by rational persuasion — the directive carries institutional weight while the principle earns assent on its own logic." ; narr:text "Atlas rollback rehearsals run monthly from now on." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "value" ; narr:reading "Competence and conservation paired — the discipline exists to preserve capability, framed as resource stewardship rather than aspiration." ; narr:text "A rollback\nwe have not rehearsed is a rollback we do not actually have." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
